oracle: subset definition (LANG84 phase 7a: an int outside i64 traps Trap.Overflow; CPython would make a bigger int). Host CPython 3.11.17, 3.12.3, 3.13.16 print the stdout before `trap:` and then 9223372036854775808, outside i64
command: {python3.11,python3.12,python3.13} -I overflow_min_floordiv_minus_one.py
